name valley_far
describe A 300 m view down a valley. The distance/LOD look shot: everything past the finest ring is a coarser node, so this is where the LOD ladder's seams, the moire Prompt 005 is about, and the fog Prompt 007 derives all become visible at once.
backend both

# TAA off for every scenario that compares a capture against a golden. Measured, not assumed:
# with TAA on, vk-vs-vk moves 0.996% of pixels at this pose against a 1.5% gate, and with it off
# 0.341% -- see dev/harness/src/image_compare.hpp for the full four-case table.
option --no-taa

pose_ground 48,0 -90 -8 12
wait 2

capture end valley_far

assert frames > 0
assert contrast_percent > 6
